"components/web/index.html" to "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Animatronic Eye</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:dark;font:16px system-ui;background:#0d1624;color:#e4edf8}\nbody{max-width:960px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{margin-bottom:4px}h2{font-size:1.25rem}\nsection{background:#18263a;border:1px solid #344358;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin:18px 0}\nbutton,input,select{font:inherit;border-radius:6px;padding:9px;border:1px solid #63768d}\nbutton{background:#20497a;color:white;cursor:pointer;margin:5px}button.stop{background:#9a263a}\ninput[type=number]{width:90px}input[type=range]{width:65%;vertical-align:middle}label{display:inline-block;margin:8px}\nsmall{color:#aebfd4}#message{position:sticky;top:0;padding:12px;background:#24364e;z-index:2;white-space:pre-wrap}\ncanvas{width:100%;max-width:400px;background:#0d1624;border-radius:12px}.grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;align-items:center}\ntable{border-collapse:collapse}td,th{padding:7px;text-align:left}@media(max-width:600px){body{padding:12px}td,th{padding:3px}input[type=number]{width:60px;max-width:65px}}\n</style>\n<h1>Animatronic Eye</h1><small>XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense · Controle e calibração</small>\n<p id=\"message\" role=\"status\">Conectando…</p>\n<section><h2>Controle</h2><p>Na inicialização os servos ficam desativados. Centralize os servos com o mecanismo desconectado antes de montar.</p>\n<button id=\"arm\">Ativar servos</button><button class=\"stop\" id=\"stop\">Parar / desativar</button>\n<label>Modo <select id=\"mode\"><option value=\"manual\">Manual</option><option value=\"random\">Aleatório</option><option value=\"tracking\">Seguir rosto</option></select></label>\n<div class=\"grid\"><div><p><label>Horizontal <input id=\"x\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\"0\"></label></p>\n<p><label>Vertical <input id=\"y\" type=\"range\" min=\"-1\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\"0\"></label></p>\n<p><label>Pálpebra <input id=\"lid\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\"0\"></label></p>\n<button id=\"center\">Centralizar</button></div><canvas id=\"eye\" width=\"400\" height=\"240\" aria-label=\"Posição do olho\"></canvas></div>\n<label>Resposta (0,01–1) <input type=\"number\" id=\"smoothing\" min=\".01\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\".12\"></label>\n<label>Velocidade (unid./s) <input type=\"number\" id=\"speed\" min=\".05\" max=\"3\" step=\".05\" value=\".8\"></label>\n<label>Deadband <input type=\"number\" id=\"deadband\" min=\"0\" max=\".5\" step=\".01\" value=\".08\"></label>\n<button id=\"tuning\">Aplicar movimento</button></section>\n<section><h2>Calibração visual</h2><p>Pulsos em microssegundos. Comece em 1500 µs e ajuste em pequenos passos. Os limites precisam respeitar mínimo &lt; centro &lt; máximo.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Eixo</th><th>Mín.</th><th>Centro</th><th>Máx.</th><th>Inverter</th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"axes\"></tbody></table>\n<label>Aberta <input id=\"lid_open\" type=\"number\" min=\"500\" max=\"2500\" step=\"5\"></label>\n<label>Fechada <input id=\"lid_closed\" type=\"number\" min=\"500\" max=\"2500\" step=\"5\"></label>\n<label><input id=\"lid_enabled\" type=\"checkbox\"> Habilitar pálpebra</label>\n<p><button id=\"preview\">Aplicar sem gravar</button><button id=\"save\">Gravar na NVS</button></p>\n<div id=\"positions\"></div><small>Aplicar altera os limites imediatamente; mantenha os servos desativados ao configurar valores novos. Os botões de teste usam os limites aplicados. Reiniciar restaura a última gravação.</small></section>\n<section><h2>Câmera e tracking</h2><label><input id=\"camera\" type=\"checkbox\"> Câmera ligada</label>\n<p id=\"cameraStatus\">Câmera desligada</p><small>A câmera inicia desligada. Ligue-a e escolha “Seguir rosto” para tracking. Sem rosto, mantém a posição. A visualização acima mostra coordenadas; não é transmissão de vídeo.</small></section>\n<section><h2>Wi-Fi</h2><form id=\"wifiForm\"><label>Rede <input id=\"ssid\" maxlength=\"32\" required autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n<label>Senha <input id=\"password\" type=\"password\" maxlength=\"63\" autocomplete=\"new-password\"></label><button>Salvar e reiniciar</button></form>\n<small>Rede de recuperação permanece disponível em 192.168.4.1, inclusive se a conexão com o roteador falhar.</small></section>\n<section><h2>Atualização OTA</h2><p>Selecione apenas o arquivo animatronic_eye.bin gerado para esta placa.</p>\n<input id=\"firmware\" type=\"file\" accept=\".bin\"><button id=\"upload\">Enviar firmware</button><progress id=\"progress\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\"></progress>\n<small>O envio desativa os servos e a câmera. O firmware anterior é restaurado se o novo não confirmar a inicialização.</small></section>\n<script>\nconst element=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nconst message=text=>element('message').textContent=text;\nasync function api(path,body){\n const response=await fetch('/api/'+path,{method:body?'POST':'GET',headers:body?{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Eye-Request':'1'}:{},body:body?JSON.stringify(body):undefined});\n if(!response.ok)throw Error(await response.text());\n return response.json();\n}\nfunction action(callback){return async()=>{try{await callback();message('Comando aplicado.')}catch(error){message(error.message)}}}\nfor(const axis of ['x','y']){\n const row=document.createElement('tr');\n row.innerHTML='<th>'+axis.toUpperCase()+'</th>'+['min','center','max'].map(field=>'<td><input type=\"number\" min=\"500\" max=\"2500\" step=\"5\" id=\"'+axis+'_'+field+'\"></td>').join('')+'<td><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"'+axis+'_inverted\"></td>';\n element('axes').append(row);\n for(const [label,value] of [['mínimo',-1],['centro',0],['máximo',1]]){\n  const button=document.createElement('button');button.textContent=axis.toUpperCase()+' '+label;\n  button.onclick=action(async()=>{await api('control',{mode:'manual'});await api('control',{[axis]:value})});\n  element('positions').append(button);\n }\n}\nlet initialized=false,busy=false;\nasync function poll(){\n if(busy)return;busy=true;\n try{\n  const state=await api('status');\n  element('arm').textContent=state.armed?'Servos ativados':'Ativar servos';\n  element('cameraStatus').textContent=state.camera_ready?(state.face?'Rosto detectado':'Câmera pronta · procurando rosto'):'Câmera desligada · '+state.camera_error;\n  if(document.activeElement!==element('mode'))element('mode').value=state.mode;\n  element('camera').checked=state.camera;\n  if(!initialized){\n   for(const axis of ['x','y'])for(const field of ['min','center','max','inverted']){\n    const input=element(axis+'_'+field);if(field==='inverted')input.checked=state.calibration[axis][field];else input.value=state.calibration[axis][field];\n   }\n   for(const field of ['lid_open','lid_closed'])element(field).value=state.calibration[field];\n   element('lid_enabled').checked=state.calibration.lid_enabled;\n   for(const field of ['smoothing','speed','deadband'])element(field).value=state[field];\n   initialized=true;message('Conectado. Revise a calibração antes de ativar os servos.');\n  }\n  const context=element('eye').getContext('2d');context.clearRect(0,0,400,240);\n  context.fillStyle='#dceafb';context.beginPath();context.ellipse(200,120,150,85,0,0,Math.PI*2);context.fill();\n  context.fillStyle='#348dbe';context.beginPath();context.arc(200+state.x*95,120+state.y*50,38,0,Math.PI*2);context.fill();\n  context.fillStyle='#091627';context.beginPath();context.arc(200+state.x*95,120+state.y*50,18,0,Math.PI*2);context.fill();\n  if(state.face){context.strokeStyle='#ffce63';context.strokeRect(200+state.face_x*180-8,120+state.face_y*100-8,16,16)}\n }catch(error){message('Sem conexão: '+error.message)}finally{busy=false}\n}\nelement('arm').onclick=action(()=>api('control',{armed:true}));\nelement('stop').onclick=action(()=>api('control',{armed:false,mode:'manual'}));\nelement('mode').onchange=action(()=>api('control',{mode:element('mode').value}));\nelement('camera').onchange=action(()=>api('control',{camera:element('camera').checked}));\nfor(const axis of ['x','y','lid'])element(axis).onchange=action(async()=>{await api('control',{mode:'manual'});await api('control',{[axis]:Number(element(axis).value)})});\nelement('center').onclick=action(async()=>{await api('control',{mode:'manual'});await api('control',{x:0,y:0,lid:0});element('x').value=element('y').value=element('lid').value=0});\nelement('tuning').onclick=action(()=>api('control',Object.fromEntries(['smoothing','speed','deadband'].map(field=>[field,Number(element(field).value)]))));\nfunction calibration(persist){\n const value={persist};\n for(const axis of ['x','y'])value[axis]={min:Number(element(axis+'_min').value),center:Number(element(axis+'_center').value),max:Number(element(axis+'_max').value),inverted:element(axis+'_inverted').checked};\n for(const field of ['lid_open','lid_closed'])value[field]=Number(element(field).value);\n value.lid_enabled=element('lid_enabled').checked;return value;\n}\nelement('preview').onclick=action(()=>api('calibration',calibration(false)));\nelement('save').onclick=action(()=>api('calibration',calibration(true)));\nelement('wifiForm').onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();try{await api('wifi',{ssid:element('ssid').value,password:element('password').value});message('Wi-Fi salvo. Reiniciando…')}catch(error){message(error.message)}};\nelement('upload').onclick=()=>{\n const file=element('firmware').files[0];if(!file){message('Selecione o firmware .bin.');return}\n if(!confirm('Atualizar firmware e reiniciar?'))return;\n const request=new XMLHttpRequest();request.open('POST','/api/ota');request.setRequestHeader('X-Eye-Request','1');request.setRequestHeader('Content-Type','application/octet-stream');\n request.upload.onprogress=event=>{if(event.lengthComputable)element('progress').value=100*event.loaded/event.total};\n request.onload=()=>message(request.responseText);request.onerror=()=>message('Falha no envio; reconecte e tente novamente.');\n request.send(file);message('Enviando firmware…');\n};\npoll();setInterval(poll,1500);\n</script></html>\n",
"components/web/web.cpp" to "#include \"web.hpp\"\n#include \"core.hpp\"\n#include \"calibration.hpp\"\n#include \"eye_wifi.hpp\"\n#include \"eye_ota.hpp\"\n#include \"esp_http_server.h\"\n#include \"cJSON.h\"\n#include <cstring>\n#include <cstdlib>\n#include <cstdio>\nextern const char page_start[] asm(\"_binary_index_html_start\");\nstatic bool mutation_allowed(httpd_req_t *request) {\n    char header[8]={};\n    if(httpd_req_get_hdr_value_str(request,\"X-Eye-Request\",header,sizeof(header))==ESP_OK && strcmp(header,\"1\")==0) return true;\n    httpd_resp_send_err(request,HTTPD_403_FORBIDDEN,\"Missing request header\");\n    return false;\n}\nstatic esp_err_t send_json(httpd_req_t *request,cJSON *json) {\n    char *text=cJSON_PrintUnformatted(json);\n    cJSON_Delete(json);\n    if(!text) return httpd_resp_send_err(request,HTTPD_500_INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR,\"Out of memory\");\n    httpd_resp_set_type(request,\"application/json\");\n    httpd_resp_set_hdr(request,\"Cache-Control\",\"no-store\");\n    esp_err_t result=httpd_resp_sendstr(request,text);\n    cJSON_free(text);\n    return result;\n}\nstatic cJSON *axis_json(const AxisCalibration &axis) {\n    cJSON *json=cJSON_CreateObject();\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"min\",axis.minimum);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"center\",axis.center);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"max\",axis.maximum);\n    cJSON_AddBoolToObject(json,\"inverted\",axis.inverted);\n    return json;\n}\nstatic esp_err_t status_handler(httpd_req_t *request) {\n    EyeState current;\n    { StateLock lock; current=eye; }\n    cJSON *json=cJSON_CreateObject();\n    cJSON_AddBoolToObject(json,\"armed\",current.armed);\n    cJSON_AddStringToObject(json,\"mode\",current.mode==Mode::Manual ? \"manual\" : current.mode==Mode::Random ? \"random\" : \"tracking\");\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"x\",current.x); cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"y\",current.y);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"lid\",current.lid);\n    cJSON_AddBoolToObject(json,\"camera\",current.camera_requested);\n    cJSON_AddBoolToObject(json,\"camera_ready\",current.camera_ready);\n    cJSON_AddStringToObject(json,\"camera_error\",esp_err_to_name(current.camera_error));\n    cJSON_AddBoolToObject(json,\"face\",current.face);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"camera_frames\",current.camera_frames);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"camera_detections\",current.camera_detections);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"camera_capture_failures\",current.camera_capture_failures);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"camera_processing_ms\",current.camera_processing_ms);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"camera_free_heap\",current.camera_free_heap);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"camera_free_psram\",current.camera_free_psram);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"camera_uptime_ms\",current.camera_uptime_ms);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"face_hits\",current.face_hits);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"face_misses\",current.face_misses);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"face_x\",current.face_x); cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"face_y\",current.face_y);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"smoothing\",current.smoothing);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"speed\",current.speed);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(json,\"deadband\",current.deadband);\n    cJSON *calibration=cJSON_AddObjectToObject(json,\"calibration\");\n    cJSON_AddItemToObject(calibration,\"x\",axis_json(current.calibration.x));\n    cJSON_AddItemToObject(calibration,\"y\",axis_json(current.calibration.y));\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(calibration,\"lid_open\",current.calibration.lid_open);\n    cJSON_AddNumberToObject(calibration,\"lid_closed\",current.calibration.lid_closed);\n    cJSON_AddBoolToObject(calibration,\"lid_enabled\",current.calibration.lid_enabled);\n    return send_json(request,json);\n}\nstatic cJSON *read_json(httpd_req_t *request) {\n    if(request->content_len<=0 || request->content_len>2048) return nullptr;\n    char buffer[2049];\n    int received=0,timeouts=0;\n    while(received<request->content_len) {\n        int count=httpd_req_recv(request,buffer+received,request->content_len-received);\n        if(count==HTTPD_SOCK_ERR_TIMEOUT && ++timeouts<=2) continue;\n        if(count<=0) return nullptr;\n        received+=count;\n    }\n    buffer[received]=0;\n    return cJSON_ParseWithLengthOpts(buffer,received+1,nullptr,true);\n}\nstatic bool number(cJSON *json,const char *name,float &value,float low,float high) {\n    cJSON *item=cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,name);\n    if(!item) return true;\n    if(!cJSON_IsNumber(item) || !std::isfinite(item->valuedouble) || item->valuedouble<low || item->valuedouble>high) return false;\n    value=item->valuedouble;\n    return true;\n}\nstatic bool boolean(cJSON *json,const char *name,bool &value) {\n    cJSON *item=cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,name);\n    if(!item) return true;\n    if(!cJSON_IsBool(item)) return false;\n    value=cJSON_IsTrue(item); return true;\n}\nstatic bool integer(cJSON *json,const char *name,int &value) {\n    float parsed=value;\n    if(!number(json,name,parsed,500,2500) || parsed!=floorf(parsed)) return false;\n    value=parsed; return true;\n}\nstatic bool parse_axis(cJSON *json,AxisCalibration &axis) {\n    return cJSON_IsObject(json) && integer(json,\"min\",axis.minimum) && integer(json,\"center\",axis.center) &&\n        integer(json,\"max\",axis.maximum) && boolean(json,\"inverted\",axis.inverted);\n}\nstatic esp_err_t command_handler(httpd_req_t *request) {\n    if(!mutation_allowed(request)) return ESP_OK;\n    cJSON *json=read_json(request);\n    if(!cJSON_IsObject(json)) { cJSON_Delete(json); return httpd_resp_send_err(request,HTTPD_400_BAD_REQUEST,\"Invalid JSON\"); }\n    bool valid=true;\n    esp_err_t result=ESP_OK;\n    bool restart=false;\n    if(strcmp(request->uri,\"/api/control\")==0) {\n        StateLock lock;\n        EyeState next=eye;\n        valid=number(json,\"x\",next.target_x,-1,1) && number(json,\"y\",next.target_y,-1,1) &&\n            number(json,\"lid\",next.lid,0,1) && number(json,\"smoothing\",next.smoothing,0.01,1) &&\n            number(json,\"speed\",next.speed,0.05,3) && number(json,\"deadband\",next.deadband,0,0.5) &&\n            boolean(json,\"armed\",next.armed) && boolean(json,\"camera\",next.camera_requested);\n        cJSON *mode=cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"mode\");\n        if(mode) {\n            if(!cJSON_IsString(mode)) valid=false;\n            else if(strcmp(mode->valuestring,\"manual\")==0) next.mode=Mode::Manual;\n            else if(strcmp(mode->valuestring,\"random\")==0) next.mode=Mode::Random;\n            else if(strcmp(mode->valuestring,\"tracking\")==0) next.mode=Mode::Tracking;\n            else valid=false;\n        }\n        if(!next.camera_requested && next.mode==Mode::Tracking) {\n            if(cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"camera\")) next.mode=Mode::Manual;\n            else valid=false;\n        }\n        if(next.mode!=eye.mode) {\n            if(!cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"x\")) next.target_x=next.x;\n            if(!cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"y\")) next.target_y=next.y;\n        }\n        if(!next.armed) { next.target_x=next.x; next.target_y=next.y; }\n        if(valid) eye=next;\n    } else if(strcmp(request->uri,\"/api/calibration\")==0) {\n        StateLock lock;\n        if(eye.armed) {\n            cJSON_Delete(json);\n            return httpd_resp_send_err(request,HTTPD_400_BAD_REQUEST,\"Desative os servos antes de alterar a calibracao\");\n        }\n        Calibration next=eye.calibration;\n        bool persist=false;\n        valid=parse_axis(cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"x\"),next.x) &&\n            parse_axis(cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"y\"),next.y) &&\n            integer(json,\"lid_open\",next.lid_open) && integer(json,\"lid_closed\",next.lid_closed) &&\n            boolean(json,\"lid_enabled\",next.lid_enabled) && boolean(json,\"persist\",persist) && calibration_valid(next);\n        if(valid) {\n            if(persist) result=calibration_save(next);\n            else eye.calibration=next;\n            eye.mode=Mode::Manual;\n        }\n    } else if(strcmp(request->uri,\"/api/wifi\")==0) {\n        cJSON *ssid=cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"ssid\");\n        cJSON *password=cJSON_GetObjectItemCaseSensitive(json,\"password\");\n        valid=cJSON_IsString(ssid) && cJSON_IsString(password);\n        if(valid) { result=eye_wifi_save(ssid->valuestring,password->valuestring); restart=result==ESP_OK; }\n    } else valid=false;\n    cJSON_Delete(json);\n    if(!valid || result==ESP_ERR_INVALID_ARG) return httpd_resp_send_err(request,HTTPD_400_BAD_REQUEST,\"Invalid parameters\");\n    if(result!=ESP_OK) return httpd_resp_send_err(request,HTTPD_500_INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR,esp_err_to_name(result));\n    httpd_resp_set_type(request,\"application/json\");\n    httpd_resp_sendstr(request,\"{\\\"ok\\\":true}\");\n    if(restart) eye_restart_later();\n    return ESP_OK;\n}\nstatic esp_err_t page_handler(httpd_req_t *request) {\n    if(strcmp(request->uri,\"/\")!=0) {\n        httpd_resp_set_status(request,\"302 Found\");\n        httpd_resp_set_hdr(request,\"Location\",\"http://192.168.4.1/\");\n        return httpd_resp_sendstr(request,\"Open the configuration portal\");\n    }\n    httpd_resp_set_type(request,\"text/html\");\n    httpd_resp_set_hdr(request,\"Cache-Control\",\"no-store\");\n    httpd_resp_set_hdr(request,\"X-Frame-Options\",\"DENY\");\n    httpd_resp_set_hdr(request,\"X-Content-Type-Options\",\"nosniff\");\n    return httpd_resp_sendstr(request,page_start);\n}\nstatic esp_err_t upload_handler(httpd_req_t *request) {\n    if(!mutation_allowed(request)) return ESP_OK;\n    return eye_ota_upload(request);\n}\nesp_err_t web_start() {\n    httpd_config_t config=HTTPD_DEFAULT_CONFIG();\n    config.stack_size=8192; config.max_uri_handlers=8;\n    config.uri_match_fn=httpd_uri_match_wildcard;\n    config.recv_wait_timeout=10; config.lru_purge_enable=true;\n    httpd_handle_t server=nullptr;\n    esp_err_t result=httpd_start(&server,&config);\n    if(result!=ESP_OK) return result;\n    const httpd_uri_t routes[]={\n        {\"/api/status\",HTTP_GET,status_handler,nullptr},\n        {\"/api/control\",HTTP_POST,command_handler,nullptr},\n        {\"/api/calibration\",HTTP_POST,command_handler,nullptr},\n        {\"/api/wifi\",HTTP_POST,command_handler,nullptr},\n        {\"/api/ota\",HTTP_POST,upload_handler,nullptr},\n        {\"/*\",HTTP_GET,page_handler,nullptr}\n    };\n    for(const auto &route:routes) {\n        result=httpd_register_uri_handler(server,&route);\n        if(result!=ESP_OK) { httpd_stop(server); return result; }\n    }\n    return ESP_OK;\n}\n",
